511
00:26:50,234 --> 00:26:51,944
Sorry, but we still
need a moment.

512
00:26:55,072 --> 00:26:56,239
- Oh!
- Hey!

513
00:26:56,240 --> 00:26:57,949
Feng!

514
00:26:57,950 --> 00:27:00,285
- Why are you here?
- I'm working here.

515
00:27:00,410 --> 00:27:02,412
- Wow!
- You're here to dine?

516
00:27:02,663 --> 00:27:04,581
No, I'm here to visit Lu-yung.

517
00:27:04,706 --> 00:27:06,749
- I'm here to visit him.
- Come inside. Come on.

518
00:27:06,750 --> 00:27:08,585
- Oh!
- [laughs] Hey.

519
00:27:08,710 --> 00:27:10,086
Do you have a reservation?

520
00:27:10,087 --> 00:27:11,630
- Damn! Do I need one?
- Just a joke.

521
00:27:11,755 --> 00:27:13,005
What the hell are you saying?

522
00:27:13,006 --> 00:27:14,299
[Chin-nan] Boss!

523
00:27:14,424 --> 00:27:15,634
Feng is here.

524
00:27:23,642 --> 00:27:24,934
[Lu-yung] Master?

525
00:27:24,935 --> 00:27:26,061
Is it good?

526
00:27:27,771 --> 00:27:30,190
Don't call me "Master" out here.

527
00:27:30,816 --> 00:27:32,442
I'm not your master.

528
00:27:34,236 --> 00:27:35,279
Here. It's hot.

529
00:27:37,656 --> 00:27:39,282
[Feng] Here's the thing,
Lu-yung.

530
00:27:39,283 --> 00:27:40,868
I know you've opened
a restaurant.

531
00:27:44,288 --> 00:27:46,456
- What are you doing?
- [Feng] Wait.

532
00:27:46,707 --> 00:27:49,458
If you don't take it,
you're insulting me

533
00:27:49,459 --> 00:27:50,419
and you're prejudiced.

534
00:27:51,879 --> 00:27:56,842
I'm here to see you and give you
a red envelope for good luck.

535
00:27:56,967 --> 00:27:58,217
MAY JIN LAI HAO
HAVE A FULL HOUSE

536
00:27:58,218 --> 00:28:00,679
[Feng] It's not much.
Just a token. Take it.

537
00:28:00,804 --> 00:28:03,306
That's my blessing for you.

538
00:28:03,307 --> 00:28:04,891
Wishing you a thriving business.

539
00:28:04,892 --> 00:28:06,185
Here's the deal then.

540
00:28:06,310 --> 00:28:08,020
You'll keep the red envelope
while I'll keep the money.

541
00:28:08,145 --> 00:28:10,439
No. Enough of your nonsense!

542
00:28:10,689 --> 00:28:12,398
- [Chin-nan laughs]
- I'll take it.

543
00:28:12,399 --> 00:28:14,318
- [Feng] That's it.
- Thank you.

544
00:28:17,905 --> 00:28:18,989
- Tell me the truth.
- Mm?

545
00:28:19,114 --> 00:28:20,365
Is it good?

546
00:28:21,783 --> 00:28:24,077
- You want the truth?
- Yeah.

547
00:28:30,334 --> 00:28:31,835
Good.

548
00:28:32,711 --> 00:28:34,337
Really good. Much improved.

549
00:28:34,338 --> 00:28:36,965
- I think you've got help
from an expert.
- [chuckles]

550
00:28:38,342 --> 00:28:40,010
This is the kitchen,

551
00:28:42,095 --> 00:28:43,888
my territory.

552
00:28:43,889 --> 00:28:46,391
I'm Feng. F-E-N-G.
Just call me Feng.

553
00:28:46,516 --> 00:28:48,100
You wrote in your profile

554
00:28:48,101 --> 00:28:50,520
that you've got catering
and kitchen experience.

555
00:28:50,771 --> 00:28:53,815
Raise your hand if you've
actually worked in a kitchen.

556
00:28:55,984 --> 00:28:58,362
- [prison mate] Sous chef.
- [Feng] Sous chef.

557
00:28:58,487 --> 00:28:59,947
[prison mate] Garde manger.

558
00:29:02,366 --> 00:29:03,533
My dad owned a restaurant.

559
00:29:03,784 --> 00:29:05,202
A restaurant owner?

560
00:29:06,495 --> 00:29:08,913
I don't care if you were a chef,
a sous chef, or a prep cook.

561
00:29:08,914 --> 00:29:10,039
You're all the same to me.

562
00:29:10,040 --> 00:29:12,375
When you're here,
follow my orders.

563
00:29:12,376 --> 00:29:14,086
We're family from now on.

564
00:29:14,211 --> 00:29:16,505
We'll do everything together.

565
00:29:16,755 --> 00:29:19,382
The point is,
don't cause any trouble.

566
00:29:19,383 --> 00:29:21,217
Work with me.

567
00:29:21,218 --> 00:29:22,969
Play along with me.

568
00:29:22,970 --> 00:29:25,180
- Any questions?
- [all] No.

569
00:29:28,809 --> 00:29:30,519
Your folks owned a restaurant?

570
00:29:33,897 --> 00:29:35,899
Are you a mute or what?

571
00:29:41,029 --> 00:29:42,281
Son of a bitch.

572
00:29:43,573 --> 00:29:46,951
I'm talking to you.
Are you a mute or what?

573
00:29:46,952 --> 00:29:49,121
What's with the damn face?
What are you looking at?

574
00:29:50,914 --> 00:29:52,332
What are you looking at?

575
00:29:54,251 --> 00:29:55,460
What's wrong with you?

576
00:29:55,585 --> 00:29:57,129
What's wrong?

577
00:29:57,254 --> 00:29:58,921
You want trouble?

578
00:29:58,922 --> 00:30:00,798
I just wanted to chat with him.

579
00:30:00,799 --> 00:30:02,133
Is it time to chat?

580
00:30:02,134 --> 00:30:03,467
You want to chat,
but he doesn't.

581
00:30:03,468 --> 00:30:05,136
Son of a bitch. Go to work.

582
00:30:05,137 --> 00:30:07,138
- [prison guard] What's wrong?
- Nothing. The wheel's stuck.

583
00:30:07,139 --> 00:30:08,097
Go.

584
00:30:08,098 --> 00:30:09,975
The wheel's stuck.

585
00:30:10,100 --> 00:30:11,059
Go ahead.

586
00:30:23,071 --> 00:30:24,865
This is the core station,

587
00:30:26,116 --> 00:30:27,409
the heart of the kitchen.

588
00:30:29,161 --> 00:30:31,580
You need to behave yourself
to come here. Come on.

589
00:30:32,914 --> 00:30:34,166
I heard...

590
00:30:34,291 --> 00:30:37,377
I heard that you're here
for attempted murder.

591
00:30:40,547 --> 00:30:42,340
Yeah.

592
00:30:42,341 --> 00:30:46,136
But you don't look like
that kind of person.

593
00:30:46,261 --> 00:30:47,553
You could've hit him back,
but you didn't.

594
00:30:47,554 --> 00:30:49,472
You took it silently.
You're different.

595
00:30:49,473 --> 00:30:53,059
It's sweltering hot here
in the kitchen,
so people are ill-tempered.

596
00:30:53,060 --> 00:30:54,353
I need someone chill.

597
00:30:55,896 --> 00:30:57,356
You'll be with me from now on.

598
00:30:59,024 --> 00:31:00,275
I've got your back.

599
00:31:01,193 --> 00:31:02,444
Mm-hmm.

600
00:31:03,862 --> 00:31:05,072
Can you wash vegetables?

601
00:31:06,531 --> 00:31:07,657
Mm-hmm.

602
00:31:07,908 --> 00:31:09,826
- Here. Sharpen the knife.
- Mm-hmm.

603
00:31:09,951 --> 00:31:11,327
- Give it to me.
- Mm-hmm.

604
00:31:11,328 --> 00:31:13,163
Stop answering me
with "Mm-hmm".

605
00:31:13,288 --> 00:31:16,082
You're not taking a shit.
You can say "yes" or "okay".

606
00:31:16,083 --> 00:31:18,543
Be nice to me, okay?

607
00:31:18,668 --> 00:31:20,045
Yes, sir.

608
00:31:20,170 --> 00:31:21,922
Yeah, isn't that better?

609
00:31:22,923 --> 00:31:24,674
[piano music playing]

610
00:31:24,925 --> 00:31:25,926
Sharpen the knife.

611
00:31:27,928 --> 00:31:29,261
Mm-mm-mm!

612
00:31:29,262 --> 00:31:31,097
Not like that.

613
00:31:31,098 --> 00:31:32,057
No.

614
00:31:34,476 --> 00:31:36,353
Like this. Not like that.

615
00:31:37,479 --> 00:31:38,438
Like this.

616
00:31:40,982 --> 00:31:43,193
Don't lift it like this.
It won't work.

617
00:31:44,319 --> 00:31:45,278
Your turn.

618
00:31:48,407 --> 00:31:50,242
Yeah. That's it.

619
00:31:59,042 --> 00:32:00,710
Lu-yung, our new mate.

620
00:32:02,212 --> 00:32:03,213
Hi, guys.

621
00:32:05,632 --> 00:32:07,384
- Here.
- [guard] Thanks.

622
00:32:07,509 --> 00:32:09,260
I want this.

623
00:32:09,261 --> 00:32:10,554
- Okay.
- Add more meatballs.

624
00:32:10,679 --> 00:32:11,972
Meatballs? Sure.

625
00:32:13,348 --> 00:32:16,143
[emotional music playing]

626
00:32:30,615 --> 00:32:31,950
[Lu-yung] <i>Thank you.</i>

627
00:32:32,075 --> 00:32:33,285
[Feng] <i>For what?</i>

628
00:32:34,077 --> 00:32:36,078
- For what you've taught me.
- Damn it.

629
00:32:36,079 --> 00:32:37,496
I can't teach
someone else, can I?

630
00:32:37,497 --> 00:32:39,165
Damn!

631
00:32:39,166 --> 00:32:41,000
Teaching you makes things
easier for me.

632
00:32:41,001 --> 00:32:42,334
Damn it.

633
00:32:42,335 --> 00:32:44,963
But you're leaving tomorrow.
I'll be alone again.

634
00:33:01,021 --> 00:33:02,354
Hey, Lu-yung?

635
00:33:02,355 --> 00:33:03,315
[Lu-yung] Hmm?

636
00:33:05,025 --> 00:33:06,985
You said you're opening
a restaurant?

637
00:33:09,029 --> 00:33:10,030
Yeah.

638
00:33:12,532 --> 00:33:13,617
Where will it be?

639
00:33:14,659 --> 00:33:17,078
The most competitive place
in the catering industry.

640
00:33:18,121 --> 00:33:19,581
It'll be difficult.

641
00:33:22,334 --> 00:33:24,002
But I have faith in you.

642
00:33:25,420 --> 00:33:26,546
You can do it.

643
00:33:28,340 --> 00:33:29,299
Thanks.

644
00:33:33,345 --> 00:33:34,304
Good luck.

645
00:33:38,808 --> 00:33:40,310
[Chin-nan] When did you get out?

646
00:33:45,440 --> 00:33:47,191
Half a year ago.

647
00:33:47,192 --> 00:33:48,401
Over half a year ago.

648
00:33:53,240 --> 00:33:55,575
To be frank,
it's not easy to find a job.

649
00:33:57,202 --> 00:34:00,038
You know, nobody would hire
ex-convicts like us.

650
00:34:02,666 --> 00:34:05,168
But I'll find one.
I'll take my time. No rush.

651
00:34:12,592 --> 00:34:13,635
Maybe you'll work with us?

652
00:34:15,637 --> 00:34:16,680
[Chin-nan] Yeah.

653
00:34:17,472 --> 00:34:18,723
Front of house is shorthanded.

654
00:34:18,848 --> 00:34:21,184
When I'm away, you'll cover
for me in the kitchen.

655
00:34:24,688 --> 00:34:26,147
The kitchen?

656
00:34:28,650 --> 00:34:31,735
I don't know if I can handle it.
Yeah, I can cook, but...

657
00:34:31,736 --> 00:34:32,696
Yeah.

658
00:34:33,572 --> 00:34:35,323
No. Don't get ahead
of ourselves.

659
00:34:36,241 --> 00:34:38,284
You can't hire me easily.

660
00:34:38,285 --> 00:34:39,201
[laughs]

661
00:34:39,202 --> 00:34:41,370
I'm not cheap. I'm expensive.

662
00:34:41,371 --> 00:34:43,331
- Right?
- [Chin-nan] Are you kidding me?

663
00:34:43,456 --> 00:34:45,542
[laughing]

664
00:34:47,502 --> 00:34:48,544
I can hire you.

665
00:34:48,545 --> 00:34:51,590
[soft music playing]

666
00:34:55,218 --> 00:34:56,469
I can afford it.

667
00:35:05,145 --> 00:35:06,605
I'll think about it.

668
00:35:08,398 --> 00:35:09,566
I'll think about it.

669
00:35:13,737 --> 00:35:15,739
Why are you smiling?
What's so funny?

670
00:35:15,864 --> 00:35:18,575
I haven't seen you for long.
I'm happy, okay?

671
00:35:19,743 --> 00:35:21,328
[Feng] Get me some chili.

672
00:35:22,746 --> 00:35:24,622
CHANG XIN'S
FATHER'S DAY SET MENU

673
00:35:24,623 --> 00:35:26,458
- [Lin Shih-ching]
Happy Father's Day!
- To pair with your meal today,

674
00:35:26,583 --> 00:35:28,334
we have a special treat
for fathers to enjoy.

675
00:35:28,335 --> 00:35:29,419
Have a taste, sir.

676
00:35:33,632 --> 00:35:37,135
FATHER'S DAY FEAST

677
00:35:50,231 --> 00:35:52,566
It's a normal
advertising article.

678
00:35:52,567 --> 00:35:54,152
Nothing special.

679
00:35:54,277 --> 00:35:55,278
What's there to read?

680
00:36:18,259 --> 00:36:22,972
You choose this wine
for our set menu pairing.

681
00:36:23,223 --> 00:36:25,308
What's the idea? Hmm?

682
00:36:27,352 --> 00:36:29,937
Well, what's special is

683
00:36:29,938 --> 00:36:33,857
we feature vegetable and seafood
dishes paired with our wine,

684
00:36:33,858 --> 00:36:37,320
enhancing the depth of flavors.

685
00:36:37,445 --> 00:36:39,655
I want to know your own idea,

686
00:36:39,656 --> 00:36:41,991
not what someone else told you.

687
00:36:43,284 --> 00:36:47,497
I want to know how much you
understand about our set menu.

688
00:36:47,622 --> 00:36:48,915
Tell me.

689
00:36:54,462 --> 00:36:55,838
My idea is simple.

690
00:36:55,839 --> 00:36:58,258
It's light,

691
00:36:59,008 --> 00:37:01,343
and less greasy,

692
00:37:01,344 --> 00:37:03,762
suitable for the young and old
in a family.

693
00:37:03,763 --> 00:37:05,765
[sighs deeply]

694
00:37:09,644 --> 00:37:12,856
We use the combination
of the four flavors
of Taiwanese cuisine,

695
00:37:15,358 --> 00:37:16,526
including three-cup,

696
00:37:16,651 --> 00:37:18,402
fermented wine,

697
00:37:18,403 --> 00:37:20,530
pungent garlic, and smoky aroma.

698
00:37:21,865 --> 00:37:23,742
Why do we use this combination?

699
00:37:23,867 --> 00:37:24,826
Tell me.

700
00:37:29,289 --> 00:37:30,957
Um...

701
00:37:33,251 --> 00:37:35,503
For example,
the seafood goes with...

702
00:37:35,962 --> 00:37:37,714
[stammers]

703
00:37:39,549 --> 00:37:41,009
- I'm...
- [sighs]

704
00:37:44,888 --> 00:37:46,389
Take away his bowl and plate.

705
00:37:50,935 --> 00:37:52,436
[sighs]

706
00:37:52,437 --> 00:37:54,314
[tense music playing]

707
00:37:56,691 --> 00:38:00,069
All you know
is to promote the wine.

708
00:38:00,320 --> 00:38:02,280
You don't know
the features of our set menu.

709
00:38:03,656 --> 00:38:05,575
If a customer asks you,
how would you respond?

710
00:38:05,700 --> 00:38:09,579
Do you know you're not even
qualified to dine with me?

711
00:38:15,960 --> 00:38:18,462
What "Successor
to a Dining Empire"?

712
00:38:18,463 --> 00:38:20,756
If you have time to mess around,

713
00:38:20,757 --> 00:38:23,760
why don't you ask our chefs
what's special about
our set menu?

714
00:38:23,885 --> 00:38:25,636
Someone like you wants
to be my successor?

715
00:38:25,637 --> 00:38:26,888
How embarrassing!

716
00:38:28,515 --> 00:38:29,598
Get out!

717
00:38:29,599 --> 00:38:32,101
[dramatic music playing]

718
00:38:47,116 --> 00:38:48,826
[upbeat music playing]

719
00:38:48,827 --> 00:38:51,787
[clerk] Does your phone number
end with 302? This way, please.

720
00:38:51,788 --> 00:38:53,455
Sorry for the wait,
here's your water.

721
00:38:53,456 --> 00:38:54,833
Do you have pets?

722
00:38:54,958 --> 00:38:57,084
If you have a photo
of you and your pets,

723
00:38:57,085 --> 00:38:59,461
you can show it for a pack
of freeze-dried meat
at the counter.

724
00:38:59,462 --> 00:39:01,631
This is our Father's Day
promotion to celebrate
the occasion.

725
00:39:01,756 --> 00:39:03,799
Just go to the counter
to collect it.
I'll let them know.

726
00:39:03,800 --> 00:39:05,676
[clerk] Thank you.

727
00:39:05,677 --> 00:39:07,637
[Shu-min] Thanks for your hard
work. Business is good, right?

728
00:39:07,762 --> 00:39:09,972
[clerk] Fully booked today
and tomorrow.

729
00:39:09,973 --> 00:39:11,099
Director Chiang is here.

730
00:39:12,725 --> 00:39:14,852
Who are those two with her?

731
00:39:14,853 --> 00:39:17,521
The one with a red necktie
is the COO of her company.

732
00:39:17,522 --> 00:39:19,648
The other one
is their major shareholder.

733
00:39:19,649 --> 00:39:22,485
- They're all big shots.
- Don't be nervous.

734
00:39:22,986 --> 00:39:24,153
Our customers love it.

735
00:39:24,404 --> 00:39:25,864
Hi, Miss Chiang.

736
00:39:25,989 --> 00:39:26,990
Come on.

737
00:39:27,991 --> 00:39:29,992
Miss Chiang, thanks for coming.

738
00:39:29,993 --> 00:39:32,745
We're here
to experience the atmosphere.
Your event is successful.

739
00:39:33,454 --> 00:39:34,913
Mr. Chen has a pet.

740
00:39:34,914 --> 00:39:35,790
Really?

741
00:39:35,915 --> 00:39:37,500
I have a Weimaraner.

742
00:39:37,625 --> 00:39:41,378
We pet owners are curious
about an event like this.

743
00:39:41,379 --> 00:39:42,754
Great.

744
00:39:42,755 --> 00:39:45,550
We'll give you some
freeze-dried meat for your dog.

745
00:39:45,675 --> 00:39:46,509
Thank you.

746
00:39:46,634 --> 00:39:48,052
Good job, Chien-wu.

747
00:39:48,177 --> 00:39:50,929
I haven't seen a full house here
for a long time.

748
00:39:50,930 --> 00:39:52,599
Thanks to her.

749
00:39:53,182 --> 00:39:54,851
He is hardworking and brilliant.

750
00:39:57,186 --> 00:39:59,438
Okay. Good job, both of you.
Keep up the good work.

751
00:39:59,439 --> 00:40:00,606
Okay.

752
00:40:00,607 --> 00:40:02,609
I'll give Mr. Chen
some freeze-dried meat.

753
00:40:03,693 --> 00:40:06,069
[Mr. Chen] Da-chin's youngest
son is doing really well.

754
00:40:06,070 --> 00:40:08,155
Yeah. I think
he's better than his brother.

755
00:40:08,156 --> 00:40:10,158
- Right?
- But he's still young.

756
00:40:11,159 --> 00:40:14,037
Chang Xin needs you
to build a new future.

757
00:40:15,538 --> 00:40:16,788
[camera beeps, shutters]

758
00:40:16,789 --> 00:40:19,834
[suspenseful music playing]

759
00:40:28,051 --> 00:40:30,178
[Mr. Chen] We'll stand by you.

760
00:40:30,887 --> 00:40:34,557
[man] Mianzi and Chang Xin's
other restaurants have performed
better than past years.

761
00:40:34,682 --> 00:40:37,684
Especially Mianzi, they've
attracted many new customers.

762
00:40:37,685 --> 00:40:40,730
The average turnover
has increased by 5.4%,

763
00:40:40,855 --> 00:40:41,898
which is brilliant.

764
00:40:42,023 --> 00:40:43,107
[laughs]

765
00:40:44,067 --> 00:40:45,526
Good job.

766
00:40:47,487 --> 00:40:49,113
I see you've learned a lot.

767
00:40:49,948 --> 00:40:51,199
- Yeah.
- [chuckles]

768
00:40:53,368 --> 00:40:54,243
Chien-yuen,

769
00:40:55,036 --> 00:40:58,915
do you have something to share
or any opinions?

770
00:41:02,835 --> 00:41:03,795
No.

771
00:41:07,548 --> 00:41:08,466
Sir,

772
00:41:09,509 --> 00:41:12,095
the employees at Mianzi haven't
had a raise in three years.

773
00:41:12,887 --> 00:41:14,973
Their turnover
has been growing steadily.

774
00:41:15,098 --> 00:41:18,768
I want to ask
for a raise for them.

775
00:41:20,603 --> 00:41:24,232
- Have you talked to their CEO?
- [Chien-wu] Yes, sir.

776
00:41:24,482 --> 00:41:27,276
Although the personnel costs
would rise slightly,

777
00:41:27,527 --> 00:41:30,488
it would be good for
employee efficiency and loyalty.

778
00:41:30,613 --> 00:41:34,033
So, we want to ride
on the event's success
to give them some encouragement.

779
00:41:38,663 --> 00:41:41,832
Evaluate the numbers
and give me a report.

780
00:41:41,833 --> 00:41:43,668
Yes, sir. Thank you, sir.

781
00:41:43,793 --> 00:41:45,169
Okay. Anything else?

782
00:41:45,294 --> 00:41:49,756
Sir, a restaurant
has got popular on social media.

783
00:41:49,757 --> 00:41:51,634
I think it's a good example
for us.

784
00:41:52,635 --> 00:41:55,013
Its name is Jin Lai Hao.

785
00:41:56,097 --> 00:41:58,307
Here's a video of their event.

786
00:41:58,558 --> 00:42:00,685
[Yi-hsuan] <i>Get ready
to challenge for Jin Lai Hao's
Strongest Dad.</i>

787
00:42:00,810 --> 00:42:02,227
<i>- Be careful.</i>
- [man] <i>Okay.</i>

788
00:42:02,228 --> 00:42:05,815
HAPPY FATHER'S DAY

789
00:42:06,524 --> 00:42:07,817
He did it!

790
00:42:07,942 --> 00:42:11,111
Congratulations.
You've won six dishes.

791
00:42:11,112 --> 00:42:12,863
<i>Can you finish them all?</i>

792
00:42:12,864 --> 00:42:14,698
<i>Of course we can.
No problem. Look at my muscle.</i>

793
00:42:14,699 --> 00:42:16,993
- [Yi-hsuan] <i>Good. You did it.</i>
- [customer] <i>Thanks.</i>

794
00:42:17,118 --> 00:42:19,996
- [Yi-hsuan] <i>Happy Father's Day.</i>
- [customer] <i>Thanks.</i>

795
00:42:21,664 --> 00:42:23,833
How's their business?

796
00:42:23,958 --> 00:42:25,792
[employee] Of course,
they're no match for us.

797
00:42:25,793 --> 00:42:28,588
But they're growing
amazingly fast.

798
00:42:29,964 --> 00:42:31,299
Amazingly fast.

799
00:42:33,342 --> 00:42:34,926
[Chin-nan] <i>Grandfathers
are welcome too.</i>

800
00:42:34,927 --> 00:42:36,179
<i>This event was
created by our owner,</i>

801
00:42:36,304 --> 00:42:37,929
<i>to wish everyone
a happy Father's Day.</i>

802
00:42:37,930 --> 00:42:39,806
[Lu-yung] <i>This store
and today's event</i>

803
00:42:39,807 --> 00:42:42,267
<i>are paying tribute to my dad,
Chou Jin-lai.</i>

804
00:42:42,268 --> 00:42:45,188
<i>With you here today,
everything is meaningful.</i>

805
00:42:45,313 --> 00:42:46,355
<i>Thank you all.</i>

806
00:42:46,606 --> 00:42:47,898
[Yi-hsuan] <i>Thank you, Boss.</i>

807
00:42:47,899 --> 00:42:49,317
IN MEMORY OF BOSS' DEAREST DAD,
CHOU JIN-LAI

808
00:42:49,567 --> 00:42:50,859
[Yi-hsuan] <i>Thank you, Boss.</i>

809
00:42:50,860 --> 00:42:52,904
<i>Okay. If you like
our dishes at Jin Lai Hao,</i>

810
00:42:53,029 --> 00:42:55,698
<i>don't forget to post and share.</i>

811
00:42:57,950 --> 00:42:59,368
[supervisor]
For the next step of investment,

812
00:42:59,619 --> 00:43:01,745
we'll do it according
to your plans, sir.

813
00:43:01,746 --> 00:43:02,955
[secretary] Sir?

814
00:43:03,998 --> 00:43:05,124
- You may go.
- Yes, sir.

815
00:43:10,880 --> 00:43:12,339
LIST OF SHAREHOLDERS

816
00:43:12,340 --> 00:43:14,050
[secretary] Sir, you asked me
to look into Chou Lu-yung,

817
00:43:14,175 --> 00:43:15,717
I found he's been
secretly buying our stock.

818
00:43:15,718 --> 00:43:18,054
He's now a major shareholder
with 3% of our shares.

819
00:43:22,141 --> 00:43:23,601
[sighs]

820
00:43:25,353 --> 00:43:26,312
[laughs]

821
00:43:34,987 --> 00:43:36,906
- [Feng] Excuse me.
- [Chien-wu] Sorry.

822
00:43:42,161 --> 00:43:43,746
[doorbell chimes]

823
00:43:43,871 --> 00:43:44,831
Hi. Welcome...

824
00:43:47,917 --> 00:43:50,128
[tense music playing]

825
00:44:02,682 --> 00:44:04,892
[music continues]

826
00:44:34,797 --> 00:44:35,965
[chuckles]

827
00:44:36,090 --> 00:44:37,300
It has been a long time.

828
00:44:38,134 --> 00:44:39,302
You're doing well.

829
00:44:40,970 --> 00:44:41,971
You too.

830
00:44:45,224 --> 00:44:46,976
Welcome to Jin Lai Hao.

831
00:44:47,101 --> 00:44:48,644
[all] Welcome!

832
00:44:48,769 --> 00:44:50,146
[dramatic music playing]

833
00:45:00,990 --> 00:45:04,035
[credits music playing]
